# Settings › Use 2D board, then a Practice board on it by clicks: a Field Kit tap, Undo, Hint,
# Escape pauses, Leave round, and the title's Resume paused board restores the board.
until 300 Discovery Merge
frames 30
click =Settings
until 60 Left-handed layout
frames 10
click Use 2D board
frames 10
save settings
click =Done
frames 10
click =Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Practice
until 60 Undo allowed
frames 10
click =Easy
until 120 =Ready
frames 150
click Field Kit generator for
frames 30
save board2d
click =Undo
frames 20
click =Hint
frames 20
key Escape 1
until 60 =Paused
frames 10
save paused
click =Leave round
until 60 Resume paused board
frames 10
click Resume paused board
until 120 =Ready
frames 120
expect Board restored.
save restored
